# Conflict policy for scripts/sync-caelestia.sh. One rule per line:
#   ours   <glob>    keep midnight's version
#   theirs <glob>    take Caelestia's version
# Later rules win. A file with no matching rule stops the sync so it can be
# discussed. Globs match the whole path and * also crosses directories.
#
# Examples (none enabled yet):
# ours   README.md
# ours   modules/launcher/*
# theirs nix/*
# theirs .github/*
